			"color":"#232",
			"widgets_values":[
				"Transform the layout of the graphic design into an image with a three-dimensional presentation effect. In a simple and modern interior space, the design of the cultural wall uses matte white texture on the wall surface, and is equipped with a ceiling and line lighting at the top. On both sides, simple flower pots with green plants are placed. The floor presents a smooth and reflective light effect of light-colored stone. The graphic design layout is transformed into a three-dimensional form composed of metal or acrylic or PVC materials and presented on the wall. The glossy finish of the metal paint gives it a three-dimensional and refined feel. The text part is made of metal or acrylic materials and is produced through UV printing technology, clearly engraved and imitating the shadows and three-dimensional effects as they would be after actual installation. Text or block display boards are installed on the wall, showing the integration of the material with the wall (such as the subtle shadows of the metal edges and the projections of three-dimensional elements), simulating the light and shadow layers under real lighting."
			],
